And this is the conclusion I implemented for my way of playing,
to use a stack of daggers. Even ordinary (non-elven) ones are
fine, and if you're playing a chaotic character where elves are
peaceful you may only get sufficient amounts of simple daggers
(i.e. if you don't want to kill those peaceful elves).
It's also just too convenient to not need to switch weapons for
ranged attacks and melee; you can just throw projectiles with a
melee weapon wielded. Of course as it's implemented in Nethack
you can also use your ranged weapon all the time even on melee
distance; this is a feasible option for all multi-shot classes
at least.

